+- [x] 1.2 Preserve strict boundaries and catalog-domain anchoring for the rule; add focused unit tests proving mixed-side pairs, embedded lookalikes, unknown codes, and unsupported product text do not gain or collapse a connection meaning.
 
 ## 2. Retrieval contract regression coverage
 
-- [ ] 2.1 Add or update mocked hybrid-retriever tests to verify a clean symmetric-shorthand alternate is queried in addition to the original, candidates are deduplicated by LD id, and original candidates survive an alternate-query error.
-- [ ] 2.2 Add or update matcher integration coverage showing the source tender text, rather than the canonical alternate, remains the reranker input and `MatchResult.query` for a supported shorthand query.
